<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves fall FIM 2.55 bln in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves fall FIM 2.55 bln in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for the week to April 30 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to April 23:</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 58,775	61,325</p>
<p> Money market intervention    17,070	17,070</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,904	 1,904</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,047	 2,248</p>
<p> Other				 6,849	 6,824</p>
<p> Total assets		     86,645	89,371</p>
<p>In the previous week, to April 23, reserves rose by 884 million markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
